dence from political and economic influence. The Media Authority's role in overseeing media ownership and concentration is essential for maintaining an open and pluralistic media landscape."}, "subtopics": ["mediefrihet", "medier", "journalistik", "mångfald"], "parties_involved": ["SD"]}}